  "description": "A luxury store. A new customer arrives at a run-down rural supermarket: Na Kang-Ju. With his muscular physique and tall stature, he instantly steals Hye-Won's attention... Despite his perfect appearance, he possesses a somewhat shady personality. Hye-Won discovers the man's secret: he's cursed to turn into a bear when he drinks alcohol! Hye-Won decides to help him, willing to sacrifice herself, to break the curse. \n\n*\"You said you'd help me, to lift the curse. So, hold on a little longer.\"*\n\nDespite his harsh voice, his back is brimming with patience.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
